      <p><seg source="#source-459-471">唯御送り</seg><seg type="warichu" rend="two-line" source="#source-471-534"><seg source="#source-489-507">但万国公法。</seg></seg><seg source="#source-534-537">難</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-537-549">レ</note><seg source="#source-549-555">有奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-555-567">レ</note><seg source="#source-567-606">存候。そして活板字がたり不</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-606-618">レ</note><seg source="#source-618-621">申</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-627-678"><seg source="#source-621-627">ざれ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-651-663">（ママ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-678-738">バ、其不足の字ハ御手許より御頼か、又ハ伏</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-741-786"><seg source="#source-738-741">水</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-762-771">（見）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-786-837">ニて御相談、以前の板木師ニ御申付可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-837-849">レ</note><seg source="#source-849-852">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-852-864">二</note><seg source="#source-864-870">成下</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-870-882">一</note><seg source="#source-882-885">奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-885-897">レ</note><seg source="#source-897-917">頼候。謹言。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-917-949" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
